    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Roulette Briefcase / Revolver</h2><p>A transforming briefcase and revolver whose current roulette result changes the revolver damage die.</p><p><strong>Roulette:</strong> Spin Roulette or fire the Grappling Hook to randomize the revolver die: d4, d6, d8, d10, d12, or d12.</p><p><strong>Slot Charge:</strong> Slot Lever spends the single Charge and arms Jackpot Barrage. At the start of the wielder's turns while spent, roll 1d6; on a 6 the Charge returns.</p><p><strong>Jackpot Barrage:</strong> Roll 1d6 and fire that many revolver shots, each using the current roulette damage die.</p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
    },
